+\frac{2u^2}{st}
\right]
}
\]
where \(\theta\) is the angle between the incoming and outgoing electron in the center-of-mass frame, so
\[
t=-\frac{s}{2}(1-\cos\theta),\qquad
u=-\frac{s}{2}(1+\cos\theta).
\]

